  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twende Mbele (&#x201c;Going Forward&#x201d;) &#x2013; Strengthening African Monitoring and Evaluation Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will support the South African Government Department of Planning, Monitoring and Evaluation (DPME) and their technical partner, the Centres for Learning on Evaluation and Results (CLEAR), to strengthen monitoring and evaluation (M&amp;E) systems and practices in selected African countries, via the Twende Mbele (&#x2018;Going Forward Together&#x2019;) programme.</narrative>
  </description>
